@startuml
title Concurrency - L0 Overview
actor Caller
participant AsyncExecutor
participant "TaskExecutionTemplate" as T
participant "ThreadPoolExecutor" as P
participant "Business Task" as B
Caller -> AsyncExecutor : submit / run / supply
AsyncExecutor -> T : submit(AsyncTask)
T -> P : execute(TaskCommand)
P -> B : run()
B --> P : result / failure
T --> Caller : CompletableFuture / TaskHandle
@enduml
